WEBVTT

00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:04.033
The root graph orders stages: wood, stone, then finish

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:07.200
Double-click a subquest title to edit its objectives and rewards

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.633
Objectives connect to objectives; stage rewards connect to rewards

00:00:11.633 --> 00:00:17.733
Select a node to edit its parameters on the right

00:00:17.733 --> 00:00:21.433
Use the root breadcrumb to return; a subgraph is not a separate quest
